{"summary":"猪槽中水是猪食槽中的积水，性味无毒，主要用于治疗蛊毒，可服用一盏，也可浸泡蛇咬疮口，有疗效。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"（《拾遗》）"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":"无毒。","translation":"无毒。"},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"蛊毒，服一盏。又疗蛇咬疮，浸之效（藏器）。","translation":"治疗蛊毒，服用一盏。又治疗蛇咬疮，用此水浸泡有疗效（藏器方）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%B0%B4%E9%83%A8#豬槽中水","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:36.663Z"}